Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:24:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] Phase 11: History & Likes UI screen
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- HistoryFragment: BottomSheetDialogFragment (like DownloadQueueSheet/
  SettingsSheet, not a nav_graph destination), reachable from a new
  btnHistory entry in the settings sheet — the entry-point choice this
  phase's DoD asks to record.
- HistoryViewModel: maps Phase 9/10's HistoryEntity/LikedEntity rows to
  a shared HistoryRow display model.
- HistoryRowAdapter: one ListAdapter reused for both tabs (History:
  merged SHORT_WATCH+DOWNLOAD per Phase 9's single-table design; Liked:
  its own tab). Tapping a row opens its source URL in the browser.
- sheet_history.xml/item_history_row.xml: styled to match
  sheet_download_queue.xml/item_download.xml.
- Noted a pre-existing naming ambiguity in ARCHITECTURE.md: the existing
  btnClearHistory clears a different table (download queue history),
  unrelated to this screen's History & Likes — left as-is, out of scope
  for this phase.
